<!--
  Tack lifetime rows (plan T5, Claude default; Jeff rules at Phase 2).
  DRAFT - not applied to the live server. Applies at Tack Phase 2, at a scheduled restart, with
  the live types.xml backed up first (shared rules 9.2 step 3), after Scrawl's types.scrawl.patch.xml
  because the pinned classes inherit from Paper. Each <type> below is ADDED to
  mpmissions/dayzOffline.nasdara/db/types.xml (none exists there today). Everything not listed
  here is unchanged. Nothing spawns: nominal 0, min 0; the classes exist only through the pin
  action. lifetime 2592000 (30 days) matches Scrawl's Paper row; CE refreshes it when a player
  interacts and a raised flag pole refreshes everything in its radius, so a read note stays and a
  forgotten one despawns. crafted="1" because every instance is player-made. count_in_map="1" so
  the CE counts pinned notes toward nothing (nominal 0) but still tracks them.
  Nail stays at its live nominal 0; NailBox (140) is the nail source on Nasdara.
-->
